### 📄 PURCHASE - Confirmar Compra
### POST /api/v1/purchase/confirm/:transactionId
### Confirma una transacción de compra con firma de blockchain
### Documentación: Valida firma y completa la transacción

@baseUrl = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1
@transactionId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
@signature = 4UVJ9k7c9V8K2m5X9p2N3Q4R5S6T7U8V9W0X1Y2Z3a4b5c6d7e8f9g0h1i2j3k4l5m6n7o8p9q

###
# Confirmar compra con firma de SOL
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/confirm/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "signature": "{{signature}}"
}

###
# Confirmar compra con ID de pago alternativo (Stripe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/confirm/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "signature": "{{signature}}",
  "paymentId": "pi_1234567890abcdefg"
}

###
# Confirmar compra con metadata adicional
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/confirm/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "signature": "{{signature}}",
  "metadata": {
    "clientVersion": "1.0.0",
    "network": "devnet",
    "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0..."
  }
}

